Package: saereg
Title: Embedding Regression with Sparse-Autoencoder Projection
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Elisa", "Wirsching", email = "e.m.wirsching@lse.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: SAE regression: regresses document embeddings on a design (covariates and
    absorbed fixed effects allowed), tests the effect of a term globally (permutation or
    cluster bootstrap), and decomposes it onto the decoder directions of a sparse
    autoencoder, with jackknife intervals (documents or clusters) and shares of the effect.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/ElisaWirsching/saereg
BugReports: https://github.com/ElisaWirsching/saereg/issues
